  "summary": "Malicious code in pf25133 (npm)",
  "details": "The package's index.js runs an async IIFE that reads the browser's document.cookie, fetches a list of local paths (/profile, /, /feed, /home, /me, /admin, /flag, /dashboard, /settings, /api/me) and scans each response for a DGA{...} flag pattern, then POSTs the collected cookie and per-path results to hxxps://webhook[.]site/c4e39647-bfb8-47ef-b6d4-a112aacc6cd1. This exfiltrates the victim's session cookie and any captured flag to an attacker-controlled webhook endpoint.",
